Ability: CUSUM Charts

  Tabular Cumulative Sum (CUSUM) control charts are time-weighted charts optimized to detect
  very small process mean shifts (typically 0.5 to 2.0 standard deviations) by accumulating
  historical process shifts. Symmetrical dual accumulators plot positive upper deviations (CUSUM Upper)
  up to +h and negative lower deviations (CUSUM Lower) down to -h.

